1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,310
Smoking on planes

2
00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:03,118
has been banned for decades.

3
00:00:03,138 --> 00:00:04,018
So why is there still

4
00:00:04,018 --> 00:00:05,783
an ashtray in the bathroom?

5
00:00:05,803 --> 00:00:06,833
Wait. What?

6
00:00:06,853 --> 00:00:07,983
It's not a mistake.

7
00:00:07,983 --> 00:00:09,026
It's the law.

8
00:00:09,046 --> 00:00:10,876
Aviation rules require

9
00:00:10,876 --> 00:00:11,706
an ashtray near

10
00:00:11,706 --> 00:00:13,246
every lavatory door,

11
00:00:13,246 --> 00:00:15,362
even on non-smoking planes.

12
00:00:15,382 --> 00:00:16,452
Because engineers know

13
00:00:16,452 --> 00:00:18,159
one thing about people.

14
00:00:18,179 --> 00:00:19,009
Someone will break

15
00:00:19,009 --> 00:00:20,261
the rules anyway.

16
00:00:20,281 --> 00:00:21,746
Just one. Real quick.

17
00:00:21,766 --> 00:00:22,896
And when they panic,

18
00:00:22,896 --> 00:00:24,590
where does that cigarette go?

19
00:00:24,610 --> 00:00:26,110
Straight into the trash bin,

20
00:00:26,110 --> 00:00:28,027
full of dry paper towels.

21
00:00:28,047 --> 00:00:28,807
On a plane, a fire

22
00:00:28,807 --> 00:00:30,864
is the last thing you want.

23
00:00:30,884 --> 00:00:31,964
So the ashtray gives them

24
00:00:31,964 --> 00:00:33,782
a safe place to put it out.

25
00:00:33,802 --> 00:00:35,512
Rules are for most people.

26
00:00:35,512 --> 00:00:37,387
Design is for everyone else.

27
00:00:37,407 --> 00:00:39,147
And yes, smoking on a plane

28
00:00:39,147 --> 00:00:40,437
can still get you fined.

29
00:00:40,437 --> 00:00:41,440
Big time.

30
00:00:41,460 --> 00:00:42,360
Follow for more

31
00:00:42,360 --> 00:00:43,447
hidden designs.
